@startuml state_process_lifecycle
title Service Lifecycle States (Nomad job + ServiceRunner, post-migration)

skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor<<normal>> #C8E6C9
    BackgroundColor<<transient>> #FFF9C4
    BackgroundColor<<error>> #FFCDD2
}

[*] --> Stopped

state "Stopped" as Stopped <<normal>> {
}
note right of Stopped
  Job spec exists in Nomad
  (or local config), no allocation
  is currently running.
end note

state "Starting" as Starting <<transient>> {
}

state "Running" as Running <<normal>> {
}
note right of Running
  Allocation alive on a Nomad client.
  Wrapper has exec'd the service binary.
  ServiceRunner has registered with Consul
  and the gRPC health check is passing.
end note

state "Stopping" as Stopping <<transient>> {
    state "Nomad signal" as Sig
    state "Drain gRPC" as Drain
    state "Force kill" as Kill

    [*] --> Sig
    Sig --> Drain : signal forwarded\nby wrapper
    Drain --> Kill : kill_timeout exceeded
    Drain --> [*] : Server::Shutdown\ncompletes + Consul\ndereg ok
    Kill --> [*] : SIGKILL /\nTerminateProcess
}
note right of Stopping
  **Phase 1 — Nomad signal:**
  Operator hits "Stop job" → Nomad
  sends SIGTERM (Linux) or
  CTRL_BREAK_EVENT (Windows).
  Wrapper forwards to the service.

  **Phase 2 — Drain:**
  ServiceRunner signal handler calls
  grpc::Server::Shutdown(deadline);
  in-flight RPCs complete, then
  ConsulRegistration.deregisterService().

  **Phase 3 — Force:**
  If kill_timeout (default 5s) elapses
  before drain completes, Nomad sends
  SIGKILL / TerminateProcess.  Consul
  TTL eventually reaps the entry.
end note

state "Crashed" as Crashed <<error>> {
}
note left of Crashed
  Process exited unexpectedly.
  Consul health check fails
  within ~3s; entry is marked
  critical, then deregistered
  by Nomad after deregister_after.
end note

' ============================================================================
' Transitions
' ============================================================================

Stopped --> Starting : start_processes([name])
Starting --> Running : process spawned\n(PID assigned)
Starting --> Crashed : spawn failed\n(bad config, missing script)

Running --> Stopping : stop_processes([name])
Running --> Crashed : unexpected exit\n(exception, OOM, etc.)

Stopping --> Stopped : clean exit\n(service unregistered)

Crashed --> Stopped : acknowledged\n(next tick loop)
Crashed --> Starting : restart attempt

Stopped --> [*] : remove_config(name)\nor remove_service(name)

' ============================================================================
' Legend
' ============================================================================

legend right
    |= Color |= Meaning |
    | <#C8E6C9> | Stable state |
    | <#FFF9C4> | Transient state |
    | <#FFCDD2> | Error state |

    **Key files:**
    ServiceRunner — gRPC + Consul lifecycle
    NomadHubAdapter — start/stop via HTTP API
    wrapper.bat / .sh — signal forwarding
endlegend

@enduml
